<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange ended higher in moderate trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 74.58 to close at 7303.46.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite rose 3.06 to 437.20.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.30.</p>
<p>Advances led declines 1410 to 1042.</p>
<p>Volume was 447,165,150 compared with 345,134,580 on Monday.</p>
